{title: I shall know Him by the nail prints}
{x_aka: I Shall Know Him}
{x_theme: salvation}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/I shall know Him.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
I shall know Him, I shall know Him,
And redeemed by His side I shall stand,
I shall know Him, I shall know Him,
By the print of the nails in His hand.
